<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/21/eng@/~cl_12__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "in subsection (3), by substituting for subsection (3) the following subsection: “(3) A petitioning creditor shall not be entitled to commence any bankruptcy action— (a) against a social guarantor; and (b) against a guarantor other than a social guarantor unless the petitioning creditor has obtained leave from the court.”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/21/eng@> .
