<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/21/eng@/~cl_36> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/21/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/21/eng@> .
